<title>AUSTRIA: TABLE-Austria June yr/yr inflation 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Austria June yr/yr inflation 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	     JUNE*	MAY     JUNE 1996**</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise	 0.0	  0.1	    0.5</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	     1.2	  1.5	    1.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1996)	    101.3	101.3	  130.6</p>
<p>NOTES -- * preliminary figures</p>
<p>	    ** base 1986.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
